   "text": "Ashtak varga is a system of assessing the strength and",
   "bbox": [
    434,
    1276,
    1585,
    1338
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "results of planets mainly in transit. As its name suggests it is",
   "bbox": [
    358,
    1326,
    1583,
    1392
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "comprised of 8 factors ie the 7 planets from Sun to Saturn and",
   "bbox": [
    358,
    1378,
    1581,
    1446
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "the lagna. In this system planets give good results when",
   "bbox": [
    357,
    1430,
    1580,
    1499
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "located in certain specified houses counted from their own",
   "bbox": [
    354,
    1483,
    1577,
    1551
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "natal position and from other planets and the lagna. The",
   "bbox": [
    352,
    1535,
    1578,
    1605
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "author, therefore proceeds to specify these good houses for the",
   "bbox": [
    352,
    1588,
    1577,
    1658
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "assessment purposes.",
   "bbox": [
    354,
    1646,
    788,
    1692
   ]
  },
