   "text": "Sun",
   "bbox": [
    349,
    1749,
    463,
    1786
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "When in transit is located in the following number of",
   "bbox": [
    425,
    1827,
    1577,
    1893
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "houses counted from its position in the natal chart gives good",
   "bbox": [
    347,
